kerf-recipe 1
# A take read back: the guide as how near each pixel is, the take a model makes of it, and
# that take's own depth as a model reads it, to hold beside the guide.
render s2 {guide.mp4} pass=depth size=832x480 rate=16
generate model=shot prompt="a red sports car drives along a wet city street at dusk, cinematic, photorealistic" guide={guide.mp4} seconds=4 seed=7 out={take.mp4}
generate model=depth guide={take.mp4}
